data: {"type":"thought","content":"已为你生成静态任务计划：\n\n1. 合同文档智能审查与合规诊断 - Skill: platform.document.contract-reviewer@1.0.2 (workflow)\n\n执行单 ID: `d9e6a5ba-283c-47a3-918b-479d3ce8afaf`。正在跟踪流程执行状态...\n","data":{"executionId":"d9e6a5ba-283c-47a3-918b-479d3ce8afaf","status":"running","deterministicPlan":{"objective":"请审查以下采购合同，我方为买方，并生成审查报告。\n生产设备采购合同\n合同编号：CRW_20261016_A\n甲方：星桥测试公司（买方）\n乙方：云帆测试公司（卖方）\n第一条 标的\n标记CRW_ITEM_A，乙方向甲方供应设备一台，总价100000元。\n\n第二条 验收\n标记CRW_ACCEPT_A，设备到货卸车即视为最终验收合格，甲方不得提出任何质量异议。\n\n第三条 责任\n标记CRW_LIABILITY_A，乙方故意或重大过失造成甲方损失的，乙方亦不承担任何赔偿责任。\n\n第四条 付款\n标记CRW_PAYMENT_A，甲方在设备验收合格后30日内支付价款。","nodes":[{"nodeId":"n1_合同文档智能审查与合规诊断","sequence":1,"title":"合同文档智能审查与合规诊断","kind":"skill","skillId":"platform.document.contract-reviewer","skillVersion":"1.0.2","runtimeType":"workflow","executionRuntimeType":"workflow","dependsOn":[],"inputBindings":{"text":{"source":"literal","value":"生产设备采购合同\n合同编号：CRW_20261016_A\n甲方：星桥测试公司（买方）\n乙方：云帆测试公司（卖方）\n第一条 标的\n标记CRW_ITEM_A，乙方向甲方供应设备一台，总价100000元。\n\n第二条 验收\n标记CRW_ACCEPT_A，设备到货卸车即视为最终验收合格，甲方不得提出任何质量异议。\n\n第三条 责任\n标记CRW_LIABILITY_A，乙方故意或重大过失造成甲方损失的，乙方亦不承担任何赔偿责任。\n\n第四条 付款\n标记CRW_PAYMENT_A，甲方在设备验收合格后30日内支付价款。"},"myPosition":{"source":"literal","value":"买方"},"contractType":{"source":"literal","value":"procurement"}},"outputContract":{"clauses":"json","metrics":"json","summary":"string","artifact":"artifact_ref","artifacts":"json","htmlReport":"string","myPosition":"string","contractType":"string","missingClauses":"json","contractTypeName":"string"},"failurePolicy":"abort","modelId":"d13e0d30-87b9-4e87-b96a-d8b1b3cf78af"}],"finalOutputs":[{"targetField":"result","fromNodeId":"n1_合同文档智能审查与合规诊断","fromNodeOutput":"artifact","expectedType":"artifact_ref","isArtifact":true},{"targetField":"summary","fromNodeId":"n1_合同文档智能审查与合规诊断","fromNodeOutput":"summary","expectedType":"string","isArtifact":false}]},"traceId":"fd8fad5b-6773-4c6f-88ea-8d6cea424388"},"seq":4,"protocolVersion":"1","sessionId":"crw-C01-1792208683484","traceId":"fd8fad5b-6773-4c6f-88ea-8d6cea424388"}

